hD     in Delta: z - z**2/2 + z**3/3 - z**4/4
hD     in nabla: z + z**2/2 + z**3/3 + z**4/4
hD     in delta: z - z**3/24 + 3*z**5/640
(hD)^2 in delta: z**2 - z**4/12 + z**6/90
h^2 f'' ~ delta^2 f              : {-1: 1, 0: -2, 1: 1}
h^2 f'' ~ (delta^2 - delta^4/12) f: {-2: -1/12, -1: 4/3, 0: -5/2, 1: 4/3, 2: -1/12}
h f'   ~ (Delta - Delta^2/2) f    : {0: -3/2, 1: 2, 2: -1/2}
